# Lowdown 샌드박스 행동 관측 — 하루 한 번(타이머). 결과는 비공개 테이블(sandbox_observe_*)에만 쓴다.
# 기존 실행(lowdown-sandbox.service)이 돌고 있으면 스스로 건너뛴다(sandbox_batches 의 끝나지 않은 최근 묶음).
[Unit]
Description=Lowdown sandbox behavior observation (strace runtime)
Wants=network-online.target
After=network-online.target docker.service lowdown-egress.service
Requires=docker.service lowdown-egress.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=lowdown
Group=lowdown
EnvironmentFile=/etc/lowdown/sandbox.env
Environment=HOME=/var/lib/lowdown SANDBOX_ROOT=/var/lib/lowdown
WorkingDirectory=@REPO_DIR@
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/node @REPO_DIR@/sandbox/runner.ts --observe
TimeoutStartSec=3h
KillSignal=SIGTERM
TimeoutStopSec=120
Nice=10
NoNewPrivileges=yes
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=yes
PrivateTmp=yes
ReadWritePaths=/var/lib/lowdown /var/log/lowdown-strace
